Third-party notices

No third-party source is vendored in this repository.

Licensee checks the runtime graph of every Gradle module. The allowlist is
Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, and BSD-3-Clause. The app will show those
notices on the open-source licenses screen built with AboutLibraries
(Stage 4, settings).

Do not copy third-party source into this repository without adding a notice
here and keeping that code under its own license.
